            <div xml:id="d144">

                <pb facs="0221" n="207" sameAs="frus:frus1945v09/pg207"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">710.11/12–1245: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Uruguay</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Dawson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Montevideo</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-12-12">December 12,
                        1945</date>.<lb/>[Received December 12—9:41 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>788. After all-night debate Senate rejected this morning by 16 to 15 a motion
                    disapproving Foreign Minister’s initiative. Details later.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Dawson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
